abstract: >-
  raster2stac allows the creation of STAC Collections with
  Items and Assets starting from different kinds of raster
  datasets. It also enables automatic upload of the
  resulting files to an S3 buckets, making them publicly
  accessible worldwide. The goal is to make datasets easily
  accessible, interoperable, and shareable.
